<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112621" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλοπις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδα</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιν</span> (v. infr.), ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>battle-cry, din of
			battle,</i> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγειρε δὲ φύλοπιν αἰνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.496
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.65
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλόπιδα στήσειν πολέμοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.314
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.635
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος καὶ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.15
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				82
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῖκος φυλόπιδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.141
				</span></i>
			.—
				Ep.
			 word, used once by <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1072
			</span></i> (lyr.), and in a mock oracle, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1076
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλόπιδας προτέρων ὕμνησαν ἀοιδοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					16.50
				</span></i>
			.</div>
